  "solution": {
    "text": "$1 \\times 1!+2 \\times 2!+\\ldots+50 \\times 50!$\r\n$=(2-1) 1!+(3-1) 2!+(4-1) 3 !$\r\n$+\\ldots+(51-1) 50!$\r\n$=(2 !-1!)+(3 !-2!)+(4 !-3 !)+(51!-50!)$\r\n$+\\ldots+(511-501)$\r\n$=511-11=511-1$",
